msgstr "Connectant a les vistes"

#: src/insights.jsx:132
msgid ""
"Proactively identify and remediate threats to security, performance, "
"availability, and stability with Red Hat Insights — with predictive "
"analytics, avoid problems and unplanned downtime in your Red Hat environment."
msgstr ""
"Identifica i remedia de manera proactiva les amenaces a la seguretat, el "
"rendiment, la disponibilitat i l'estabilitat amb Red Hat Insights — amb "
"analítiques predictives, eviteu problemes i temps d'inactivitat no "
"planificats en el vostre entorn Red Hat."

